61097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your loyal German Shepherd to assist in search-and-rescue missions and send him out to sniff out explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.poster.avif?t=1764661097\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.webm?t=1764661097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.mp4?t=1764661097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to run large-scale logistics operations and play the captivating story together!</p>","developers":["Nano Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/3c88fb4e16f552d1f70cd2585198f4901009100a/header.jpg?t=1764661097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947540/949934578/c13a20d55ebd2459d33e190246e4c823d832d254/1764057368/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764075661","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947540/949934578/c13a20d55ebd2459d33e190246e4c823d832d254/1764057368/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764075661","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947540/949934578/c13a20d55ebd2459d33e190246e4c823d832d254/1764057368/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764075661","id":257237520,"name":"Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akam